WEBVTT

00:13:00.917 --> 00:13:03.976
But I have spent
every waking moment of my life

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:07.917
working for the right of every woman
to live her full potential.

00:13:09.875 --> 00:13:13.309
Imagine with me a world

00:13:13.333 --> 00:13:15.875
where thousands of us stand up

00:13:17.292 --> 00:13:21.434
and they support
other young women together,

00:13:21.458 --> 00:13:25.792
creating opportunities and choices
that benefit all.

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:30.875
And that, my friends,
can change the world.